{
    "name": "web-search",
    "title": "Web search",
    "description": "Configurable web search, public-page extraction, crawl and research with tiered provider fallback and observed request usage. Needs Pi Pocket 0.20.0+ and its experimental host.fetchPublic API. Sends queries and API keys to api.tavily.com, api.exa.ai, api.search.brave.com, google.serper.dev and api.openai.com, keyless queries to html.duckduckgo.com, and requests the public URLs you give it; if installed, runs the local donsetch binary, which contacts its own engines. Keys and settings stay in this module's own data.",
